02:55.020 --> 02:56.450
You looked?!

02:56.450 --> 02:59.530
Saejima-kun, you're such a perv!

02:59.530 --> 03:01.250
Don't put this on me!

03:01.250 --> 03:03.160
You're the one showing off.

03:03.400 --> 03:05.640
Sheesh...

03:05.640 --> 03:09.910
The ears and tail always pop out 
the minute I let my guard down.

03:10.420 --> 03:12.620
Why not leave them out all the time?

03:14.680 --> 03:18.020
You wanna see my undies that bad, huh?!

03:18.020 --> 03:19.400
Bad boy!

03:19.400 --> 03:20.440
That's not what I meant!

03:20.440 --> 03:23.560
Then... why?

03:29.260 --> 03:31.560
I think it's cute.

03:39.500 --> 03:40.320
The tail, I mean.

03:40.320 --> 03:42.210
Just the tail?!

03:42.210 --> 03:45.700
What was I thinking, 
getting all worked up about it?

03:46.660 --> 03:48.200
Saejima-kun...

03:48.200 --> 03:50.820
You'll never get a girl 
if you always talk that way.

03:50.820 --> 03:52.750
I didn't ask for your opinion.

03:52.750 --> 03:55.300
Aw, they're getting soggy...

03:56.440 --> 04:00.540
<i>I didn't say... it was </i>just<i> the tail.</i>

04:02.730 --> 04:04.580
So good!

