Morning already?

05:04.160 --> 05:05.380
Nothing to wear!

05:05.650 --> 05:08.780
My laundry's not dry yet!

05:11.500 --> 05:14.250
It's time to get going, Nyamero.

05:18.890 --> 05:21.460
I messed up my lipstick!

05:21.460 --> 05:23.790
I hate makeup!

05:25.970 --> 05:27.350
The time!

05:27.590 --> 05:30.180
<b></b>Himuro-kun

05:27.590 --> 05:30.180
<b></b>That new coffee goes 
on sale today, right?

05:27.590 --> 05:30.180
<b></b>Yes, I believe it was today.

05:27.590 --> 05:30.180
<b></b>I'd like to buy some on the way to work.

05:27.590 --> 05:30.180
<b></b>As would I.

05:28.990 --> 05:30.180
<b></b>Understood.

05:32.680 --> 05:38.190
<b>I'll meet you out front, then.</b>

05:36.190 --> 05:38.190
<b>Right!</b>

05:44.200 --> 05:45.940
I'm on my way!

05:57.680 --> 05:58.950
Fuyutsuki-san.

06:01.330 --> 06:03.060
Good morning.

06:04.400 --> 06:06.060
Good morning.

06:08.720 --> 06:10.300
Shall we?

06:10.300 --> 06:11.390
Yes...

06:20.570 --> 06:23.840
People are exhausting.

06:27.900 --> 06:30.800
Good morning!

06:31.580 --> 06:33.500
Good morning.

06:33.840 --> 06:36.440
You seem quite exhausted.

06:36.440 --> 06:39.070
Is it that obvious?

06:39.070 --> 06:40.960
I have something for you.

06:42.770 --> 06:44.990
<b>Gluco</b>

06:42.770 --> 06:44.990
<b>Gluco</b>

06:42.770 --> 06:44.990
<b>Collect all 10</b>

06:43.840 --> 06:45.000
Here.

06:45.220 --> 06:49.120
They say the calories in just one 
piece can let you run 500 meters.

06:49.400 --> 06:50.760
Would you like to try?

06:55.010 --> 06:58.140
I'm totally energized!

06:58.140 --> 07:00.580
Thanks so much!

07:01.360 --> 07:02.620
I'm glad you liked it.

07:04.940 --> 07:08.000
<i>Fuyutsuki-san's my savior!</i>

07:09.280 --> 07:12.030
<b>Gluco</b>

07:09.280 --> 07:12.030
<b>Gluco</b>

07:09.280 --> 07:12.030
<b></b>Collect all 10

07:10.000 --> 07:11.240
A prize?

07:13.280 --> 07:14.780
Morning.

07:14.780 --> 07:16.640
Good morning.

07:17.670 --> 07:19.040
A tanuki!

07:19.040 --> 07:22.260
<i>What about a fox? There's no fox?</i>

07:22.680 --> 07:24.050
What are you looking at?

07:25.790 --> 07:28.550
Saejima-kun! Good morning!

07:28.550 --> 07:31.100
Wow, that brings back memories!

07:31.100 --> 07:32.620
A prize from a caramel box?

07:32.960 --> 07:35.550
I used to collect those when I was a kid!

07:38.760 --> 07:41.440
Maybe I'll collect them, too...

07:41.940 --> 07:43.670
Even though there's no fox.

07:49.560 --> 07:51.800
<i>Another tanuki.</i>

07:52.540 --> 07:53.330
Huh?

07:54.000 --> 07:55.820
There's a rabbit...

07:56.520 --> 07:58.110
<i>Fuyutsuki-san?</i>

07:58.760 --> 08:00.360
<i>No, she's eating sukonbu.</i>

08:01.180 --> 08:04.520
<i>Well, you can buy candy in the building.</i>

08:04.520 --> 08:06.340
<i>Someone else must have bought it</i>

08:06.340 --> 08:08.060
<i>and left it here for me.</i>

08:11.660 --> 08:13.670
There's another one!

08:14.870 --> 08:17.720
<i>Himuro-kun? Probably not...</i>

08:20.760 --> 08:21.880
<i>Who could it be?</i>

08:29.790 --> 08:31.850
It's a dog today!

08:32.800 --> 08:36.800
Your desk has gotten much cuter lately.

08:36.800 --> 08:38.270
Right?

08:38.270 --> 08:42.240
It's so much fun to watch them multiply!

08:42.770 --> 08:48.350
I owe most of it to my secret helper!

08:48.350 --> 08:50.080
The Gluco Fairy?

08:51.000 --> 08:52.460
Maybe!

08:53.510 --> 08:55.350
<i>Crud...</i>

08:53.510 --> 08:57.640
<b></b>Calendar

08:53.510 --> 08:57.640
<b></b>Mon     Tue     Wed     Thu      Fri        Sat      Sun

08:55.350 --> 08:58.090
<i>I messed up my calculation 
before the deadline!</i>

08:58.620 --> 09:01.680
<i>At this rate, I'm not 
gonna have enough points!</i>

09:02.570 --> 09:05.150
The Gluco Fairy, huh?

09:13.900 --> 09:16.490
I got the whole set!

09:16.490 --> 09:18.280
Congratulations!

09:19.320 --> 09:22.830
A person can truly do anything
 they set their mind to!

09:23.060 --> 09:27.910
Although I owe half of this 
to the Gluco Fairy...

09:28.160 --> 09:33.920
<i>No more secret helper after this, I guess...</i>

09:34.300 --> 09:37.400
<i>It's a little sad, actually.</i>

09:37.400 --> 09:40.060
Oh, hey. You got the chick?

09:42.150 --> 09:45.930
I guess you won't be needing this, then.

09:47.200 --> 09:50.560
Wait, <i>you</i> were the Gluco Fairy?!

09:50.560 --> 09:52.440
The what?

09:53.160 --> 09:55.580
<i>So it was him...</i>

09:55.770 --> 09:58.610
I'm glad you finished the set.

09:58.610 --> 09:59.810
Yeah...

09:59.810 --> 10:04.820
By the way, did you hear 
they're doing a seventh set?

10:05.950 --> 10:09.960
<b>Gluco Seventh Set!!</b>

10:05.950 --> 10:09.960
<b>Now on Sale</b>

10:05.950 --> 10:09.960
<b>Collect an all-new toy series!</b>

10:06.340 --> 10:07.970
And get this...

10:07.970 --> 10:09.970
There's a fox this time!

10:09.970 --> 10:12.080
For real?!

10:12.080 --> 10:13.920
Why would I lie?

10:13.920 --> 10:16.890
Thanks for letting me know!

10:16.890 --> 10:19.460
Why are you being so nice to me, though?

10:19.460 --> 10:21.230
Why?

10:24.360 --> 10:25.400
It's out of love.

10:31.680 --> 10:32.780
For foxes.

10:33.880 --> 10:37.390
I'm excited to get the fox toy, too!

10:38.120 --> 10:40.620
I... I see.

10:42.320 --> 10:44.920
<i>Still, it is pretty nice.</i>

10:49.020 --> 10:52.270
<i>I might not be able to get all the points.</i>

10:55.740 --> 10:58.880
They're cute plates, aren't they?

10:59.220 --> 11:02.630
Were you collecting them, too?

11:02.630 --> 11:05.760
I tend to eat those 
prepackaged rolls for breakfast,

11:05.760 --> 11:09.100
and I found myself gathering points...

11:09.980 --> 11:12.400
I won't get enough myself.

11:12.860 --> 11:14.570
You can have them if you like.

11:14.900 --> 11:19.280
<i>I can't believe we're gonna get 
all the points together!</i>

11:19.280 --> 11:21.360
The chick is cute, too!

11:21.780 --> 11:25.280
<i>Fuyutsuki-san, you're </i>my<i> fairy!</i>

11:26.860 --> 11:29.350
Himuro-kun, it's a bit chilly.

11:29.350 --> 11:31.460
Ah... I'm sorry.

11:34.720 --> 11:36.760
This is for you.

11:37.040 --> 11:38.080
Is that...

11:38.490 --> 11:40.490
It's a pair, after all.

11:40.490 --> 11:42.760
That means you can have one.

11:45.140 --> 11:46.760
<b>George the Kitten</b>

11:48.810 --> 11:50.390
Thank you.

11:51.250 --> 11:52.760
I'll treasure it.

11:54.200 --> 11:56.480
<i>What a happy feeling!</i>

11:57.850 --> 11:59.600
Himuro!

11:59.600 --> 12:01.530
Oh, and Fuyutsuki-san...

12:02.020 --> 12:05.100
I totally need your advice, man.

12:08.500 --> 12:10.560
What's the matter?

12:10.990 --> 12:13.340
Senpai's ignoring me.

12:14.570 --> 12:16.830
Otonashi-san from sales, you mean?

12:16.830 --> 12:18.040
Yes.

12:18.620 --> 12:23.050
She always used to do so much for me...

12:23.420 --> 12:27.180
Otonashi-san! Otonashi-san!

12:27.540 --> 12:30.680
Break time! I brought your coffee!

12:31.530 --> 12:34.830
Otonashi-san! Where are you going?

12:34.830 --> 12:37.220
<i>Still like a baby bird.</i>

12:37.940 --> 12:42.240
She'd done so many kind things for me,

12:42.620 --> 12:46.690
I really wanted to help her in return.

12:50.200 --> 12:52.220
Otonashi-san!

12:54.500 --> 12:55.920
Katori?

12:55.920 --> 12:59.940
I want to spend the rest 
of my life making you happy!

13:02.010 --> 13:05.720
She's been avoiding me ever since.

13:06.170 --> 13:07.900
<i>That choice of words!</i>

13:10.110 --> 13:12.230
Himuro, I...

13:12.900 --> 13:16.350
If it turns out Otonashi-san 
hates me, I'll die!

13:17.320 --> 13:18.730
Katori...

13:20.120 --> 13:21.960
But you'll come back to life, right?

13:22.400 --> 13:23.710
Since you're a phoenix, I mean.

13:23.710 --> 13:26.120
Hush, Himuro-kun.

13:27.020 --> 13:29.470
I don't think she hates you.

13:29.470 --> 13:32.880
You're very devoted to your work, after all.

13:33.440 --> 13:34.670
Really?!

13:34.670 --> 13:37.380
You think so, Fuyutsuki-san?

13:37.800 --> 13:38.660
Yes.

13:39.940 --> 13:41.360
Fuyutsuki-san!

13:41.360 --> 13:43.040
Hey, cut it out!

13:43.040 --> 13:45.390
Yes, you're right.

13:46.520 --> 13:48.620
I'm back, baby!

13:48.620 --> 13:50.510
Back to life, like a phoenix!

13:50.980 --> 13:56.220
I've gotta stay strong and work harder 
to get her to accept me!

13:56.560 --> 14:00.020
You're truly devoted to her, aren't you?

14:00.020 --> 14:01.920
I sure am!

14:02.370 --> 14:04.520
There you are. Katori!

14:04.830 --> 14:08.430
I'm head over heels for Otonashi-senpai!

14:11.310 --> 14:15.000
Katori...

14:15.000 --> 14:16.780
Otonashi-senpai!

14:17.000 --> 14:22.290
You keep saying things that 
could be taken the wrong way!

14:22.860 --> 14:26.280
Now stop goofing around and get to work!

14:26.280 --> 14:28.630
But I'm on lunch!

14:29.540 --> 14:30.950
W-Well...

14:30.950 --> 14:33.550
I'm making my rounds.

14:33.550 --> 14:35.380
I'll be back by six!

14:35.720 --> 14:37.680
I'll come with you!

14:38.760 --> 14:40.520
You stay here!

14:40.520 --> 14:41.310
Yes, ma'am!

14:41.650 --> 14:43.490
<i>Totally a baby bird.</i>

14:45.540 --> 14:47.480
Have a good time!

14:48.840 --> 14:51.900
Is Otonashi-san... 
misreading your intentions?

14:53.580 --> 14:56.960
No, not at all. I mean just what I say.

14:58.720 --> 15:03.460
Before I started here, 
I was a starving artist,

15:03.460 --> 15:07.310
working part-time at my friend's café.

15:10.660 --> 15:13.400
Another day without customers!

15:13.400 --> 15:15.860
Don't cry, Kankodori-kun.

15:15.860 --> 15:18.600
See? You've got one customer.

15:18.930 --> 15:22.810
Otonashi-senpai was a regular there.

15:23.480 --> 15:25.850
She always came alone and...

15:27.020 --> 15:28.960
Yes? Otonashi speaking.

15:28.960 --> 15:30.360
Oh, about that...

15:30.360 --> 15:31.880
One lunch set.

15:32.730 --> 15:34.620
850 yen!

15:34.620 --> 15:38.240
<b>Café</b>

15:36.000 --> 15:37.760
Thank you for coming!

15:39.930 --> 15:41.510
Thank you for the food!

15:41.510 --> 15:43.040
I'll come again!

15:42.280 --> 15:44.750
She left at the speed of the wind.

15:44.750 --> 15:48.780
Her incredible speed, 
her luminescent vitality...

15:49.340 --> 15:50.350
I love her!

15:52.340 --> 15:54.760
<i>He fell in love with her speed?</i>

15:55.100 --> 15:56.740
<i>Is he a child?</i>

15:57.320 --> 16:01.500
But the more I learn about 
the person she is underneath,

16:01.500 --> 16:03.520
the more I come to love her.

16:06.020 --> 16:10.660
And, drawn like a moth to 
the flame of her exuberance,

16:08.660 --> 16:09.990
Thanks for having me!

16:11.020 --> 16:13.400
I decided to join her company!

16:13.420 --> 16:15.400
I like your energy.

16:15.790 --> 16:17.280
Welcome!

16:20.180 --> 16:21.160
Katori.

16:21.500 --> 16:24.460
This is awful. Do it over!

16:24.460 --> 16:26.160
I'm sorry...

16:26.660 --> 16:29.470
At first, she didn't seem to like me,

16:29.470 --> 16:32.650
as a new recruit with no 
sales experience at all.

16:32.650 --> 16:34.800
But I put my head down and pushed through!

16:35.110 --> 16:36.910
I'm so sorry!

16:37.460 --> 16:39.560
I'm so sorry.

16:42.060 --> 16:44.940
Yes, that's nice work!

16:45.220 --> 16:47.840
Yes! I did good!

16:47.840 --> 16:50.330
Too bright! Too loud!

16:50.750 --> 16:52.830
But then, one day...

16:53.530 --> 16:57.020
Umiyama Corporation canceled 
their contract with us?!

16:57.020 --> 16:58.460
Why?

16:58.460 --> 17:00.300
Well...

17:00.300 --> 17:05.510
The son of our competition's president, 
Onami, joined them, and then...

17:05.510 --> 17:06.940
It can't be!

17:06.940 --> 17:09.080
It's very trying.

17:09.080 --> 17:10.320
<i>Oh, no!</i>

17:10.320 --> 17:12.610
<i>This news is killing the 
sales department's morale!</i>

17:12.610 --> 17:17.790
<i>With my power as a phoenix, 
I have to bring it back to life!</i>

17:17.790 --> 17:18.840
E-Everyone—

17:20.400 --> 17:22.600
They have some nerve, don't they?

17:22.950 --> 17:26.360
I'll make them regret cutting 
ties with us like that!

17:26.760 --> 17:29.480
O-Otonashi-kun?

17:29.760 --> 17:30.640
Katori!

17:30.640 --> 17:31.490
Yes, ma'am?!

17:31.690 --> 17:34.590
I'm going to find us new clients!

17:34.590 --> 17:35.980
Come with me!

17:36.230 --> 17:38.620
<i>A-Awesome!</i>

17:40.300 --> 17:42.340
That fire in her eyes!

17:42.340 --> 17:46.480
I never knew anyone could 
burn hotter than a phoenix!

17:46.480 --> 17:50.150
Working in the sales department seems hard.

17:50.150 --> 17:51.600
It does, yes.

17:51.950 --> 17:53.170
And then...

17:55.150 --> 17:58.380
Yes! We're back on track!

17:58.380 --> 18:03.760
A client I took on just happened 
to turn into big business for us.

18:03.760 --> 18:08.100
Our flagging numbers soared back up,
 even higher than before!

18:08.540 --> 18:12.540
Katori-kun, you've truly 
revived our numbers.

18:12.540 --> 18:15.020
Just like a phoenix!

18:15.020 --> 18:17.570
No, it wasn't me at all!

18:17.960 --> 18:20.780
I owe it all to 
Otonashi-senpai's leadership!

18:21.020 --> 18:21.910
Huh?

18:22.480 --> 18:23.560
Senpai?

18:30.300 --> 18:31.680
There she is!

18:32.090 --> 18:34.510
Otonashi-senpa...i?

18:40.310 --> 18:41.300
I'm sorry.

18:41.300 --> 18:42.530
Hey, it's okay.

18:42.910 --> 18:46.020
I was just wondering where you were.

18:46.690 --> 18:48.430
I really am glad.

18:48.430 --> 18:51.310
I know I said I'd get 
our contracts back up...

18:52.230 --> 18:54.700
But I wasn't actually sure if I could.

18:55.120 --> 18:57.630
And I couldn't have done it on my own.

18:59.590 --> 19:01.960
I'm so glad you're here, Katori.

19:03.490 --> 19:05.250
<i>Otonashi-senpai...</i>

19:06.820 --> 19:10.830
<i>She's always working 
twice as hard as anyone.</i>

19:11.540 --> 19:13.850
<i>Despite that, she's still afraid...</i>

19:14.280 --> 19:16.840
<i>But she works to face those fears.</i>

19:17.680 --> 19:20.750
<i>She's a strong and impressive person.</i>

19:22.940 --> 19:27.080
That's why I want to spend 
my whole life with her!

19:27.080 --> 19:28.980
A great romance.

19:29.470 --> 19:33.160
But... even though I tell 
her I love her every day,

19:33.160 --> 19:35.470
she never takes me seriously!

19:35.470 --> 19:38.180
Maybe it's <i>because</i> you say it every day?

19:38.180 --> 19:39.600
That can't be!

19:39.920 --> 19:42.890
Why not try using different words?

19:44.510 --> 19:46.380
I see...

19:46.660 --> 19:47.630
Okay.

19:49.730 --> 19:53.120
I love you! This is eternal love!

19:53.660 --> 19:59.650
Eternal... That might actually 
not get his sincerity across.

19:59.650 --> 20:01.890
What do you think, Himuro-kun?

20:02.120 --> 20:04.460
Katori, you...

20:04.460 --> 20:07.100
Wait, no! That's not how I meant it!

20:07.100 --> 20:08.160
Wait!

20:12.360 --> 20:14.670
Y-You read me all wrong there...

20:14.670 --> 20:16.480
How, exactly?

20:17.640 --> 20:19.430
<i>Himuro got mad.</i>

20:20.000 --> 20:21.600
<i>Does that mean...</i>

20:21.600 --> 20:25.160
<i>that confession might actually 
get through to Otonashi-senpai?!</i>

20:28.160 --> 20:31.840
Eternal! That'll work!

20:31.840 --> 20:34.070
Fuyutuski-san! Thank you!

20:34.070 --> 20:36.660
Himuro, I'm gonna do it!

20:38.560 --> 20:42.140
Katori-san is a very amusing person.

20:42.420 --> 20:45.940
He's been a pest since we 
were kids in school together.

20:45.940 --> 20:48.060
This is gonna work!

20:50.400 --> 20:53.810
Boy, he's a real pain in the neck.

20:56.840 --> 21:01.200
I wish I could've gone to school with you.

21:01.600 --> 21:07.490
<i>S-School with... Fuyutuski-san?</i>

21:09.180 --> 21:13.340
<i>A youth spent... together?</i>

21:14.620 --> 21:16.840
<i>Youth...</i>

21:19.780 --> 21:21.340
<i>What the heck?!</i>

21:22.140 --> 21:24.870
<i>That'd be freakin' great!</i>

21:26.980 --> 21:28.730
<i>The greatest ever!</i>

21:29.560 --> 21:30.740
But...

21:31.400 --> 21:33.810
This is fun, too.

21:34.380 --> 21:35.840
So it's all right.

21:38.720 --> 21:39.880
Yes...

21:44.740 --> 21:46.580
<i>This moment right now...</i>

21:47.860 --> 21:50.730
<i>This is my true youth!</i>

23:27.330 --> 23:30.880
Two tickets to Nekomi Land?!

23:31.240 --> 23:34.260
What do you think, Himuro-kun?

23:34.610 --> 23:35.990
A trip together...
